<title>UK: Hypo in Essen sets 3.0 bln FRF Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>Hypo in Essen sets 3.0 bln FRF Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers CCF and Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN ESSEN</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN FRF   BASE	 3M-PIBOR  MATURITY    12.MAY.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -1/8	PAY DATE    12.MAY.97</p>
<p> REOFFER    100.058   ISS PRICE  100.058   FULL FEES   0.10</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) 100-1(M)</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    FORCE MAJ  YES</p>
<p> NOTES	HYPO IN ESSEN PFANDBRIEFE ARE RATED AAA BY S&amp;P</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
